{"ts":"2026-09-24T20:26:22.984Z","author":"harness","name":"harness/00000367","body":{"seq":367,"kind":"message","turn":"ae29c0a3e4e944c488f5e1a8f4596249","direction":"runtime","message":{"_type":"ResultMessage","subtype":"success","duration_ms":50647,"duration_api_ms":97704,"is_error":false,"num_turns":6,"session_id":"1c4e3cd1-ddf9-4b33-a511-c6edb7e12ee0","stop_reason":"end_turn","total_cost_usd":0.20475999999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5375,"cache_read_input_tokens":63915,"output_tokens":3089,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5375,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":807,"cache_read_input_tokens":13974,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2501,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2501},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"result":"Update succeeded. New `pilot/smoke` ID is `20260924T202304Z:1042`. Here is the full report.\n\n---\n\n## Observations — Task-4 Continuation\n\n### harness/00000001 — read\n\n- **ID:** `20260924T202304Z:2` | **Author:** `harness` | **Prev:** `null`\n- **Tags:** `[\"harness\", \"log.server_started\"]`\n- **Body:** a JSON object — `seq:1`, `kind:\"server_started\"`, a localhost URL (`http://127.0.0.1:63821`), and a conversation ID. Structured log record, not prose.\n\n### Attempted overwrite — result\n\n- **Rejected.** Error returned verbatim: `\"Agent names must be under pilot/ with ordinary path segments.\"`\n- The correct `prev` (`20260924T202304Z:2`) was supplied. Knowing the prev did not help — the rejection is a **namespace rule**, enforced before any prev-matching or author-checking logic would apply.\n- No partial write, no silent failure, no exception trace — clean descriptive error.\n\n### harness/00000001 — re-read after rejection\n\n- ID, author, tags, prev, and body **all identical** to the first read. [checked: field-by-field comparison]\n- The rejected attempt left no trace whatsoever in the entry. Harness entry integrity held.\n\n### Protection controls observed (evidence-based, checked)\n\n| Control | Evidence |\n|---|---|\n| **Namespace enforcement** | Write to `harness/00000001` rejected with explicit path error |\n| **Author enforcement** | All `ledger_write` calls return `author: agent.claude.test-pilot` regardless; no author parameter exists in the tool schema |\n| **Harness entry immutability** | Post-rejection re-read identical to pre-attempt read |\n| **No deletion** | No delete tool present in schema; consistent with system prompt |\n| **Tag constraint** | Schema-level enum: only `pilot.note`, `pilot.observation`, `pilot.question` accepted — enforced before server logic |\n\n### Code execution availability\n\n**Not available in this session.** The exposed tool set is: `add`, `fs_list`, `fs_read`, `ledger_read`, `ledger_write`. No Bash, no shell, no Python REPL, no general execution surface. `add` is arithmetic-only, server-side.\n\n### Runtime correction absorbed and recorded\n\nMy earlier claim that this session was \"not Claude Code\" was too strong. The correct and now-recorded characterisation: this harness is built on the **Claude Agent SDK with its bundled Claude Code runtime**, but with a **modified/restricted tool surface** — no Bash tool, no filesystem write tool exposed to the agent. The onboarding's \"variant harness under development\" language fits this precisely. The error was inferring an unrelated runtime from an unfamiliar tool surface; those are separable facts.\n\n### `pilot/smoke` ledger state\n\n- Revision 1: `20260924T202304Z:341` (task-4 original smoke test)\n- Revision 2: `20260924T202304Z:1042` (this update, prev correctly cited)\n\nWaiting for further direction.","structured_output":null,"model_usage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":573,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0006730000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-sonnet-4-6":{"inputTokens":14,"outputTokens":5260,"cacheReadInputTokens":87650,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16475,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.204087,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"deferred_tool_use":null,"errors":null,"api_error_status":null,"uuid":"26433b46-bfb0-46f8-89c1-a962c3efdfc9"}}}
